1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,788
What is this shadow? Can you guess?

2
00:00:03,188 --> 00:00:04,763
It has two wheels and pedals!

3
00:00:08,563 --> 00:00:10,021
Yes! It's a bicycle!

4
00:00:10,521 --> 00:00:12,139
Say it with me! Bicycle!

5
00:00:15,439 --> 00:00:16,511
What is this shadow?

6
00:00:16,911 --> 00:00:18,327
It flies high in the sky!

7
00:00:22,127 --> 00:00:23,583
Yes! It's an airplane!

8
00:00:24,083 --> 00:00:25,774
Say it with me! Airplane!

9
00:00:29,074 --> 00:00:30,146
What is this shadow?

10
00:00:30,546 --> 00:00:32,352
Its blades go round and round!

11
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:37,758
Yes! It's a helicopter!

12
00:00:38,258 --> 00:00:40,201
Say it with me! Helicopter!

13
00:00:43,501 --> 00:00:45,252
Last one! What is this shadow?

14
00:00:45,652 --> 00:00:47,100
It zooms up to the stars!

15
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,295
Yes! It's a rocket!

16
00:00:52,795 --> 00:00:54,465
Say it with me! Rocket!

17
00:00:57,465 --> 00:00:59,960
Wow! You got them all! How many did you guess?

